    "summary": "Under [Acts of Faith](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.acts-of-faith), an army with the **ADEPTA SORORITAS** Army Faction gains 1 Miracle die:\n\n- as each turn starts\n- each time 1 of its **ADEPTA SORORITAS** units is **destroyed**\n\nRoll a D6 for each Miracle die gained: the result is its value, which only a rule that says so can change or re-roll. Keep these dice aside as your Miracle dice pool.",
